DEPENDENCIES

ncurses

KEYBINDS

w			save chart  
m			makedir  
	esc		cancel  
	esc/q	choose dir
	enter	save named chart
	
e		 	load chart  
	l/enter	choose  
	esc		cancel  
 
r			redraw chart  
d			toggle dst
tab			live update  
q			exit astro  

s			solar return  
	k/j		up/down year  
	s/q/esc	exit mode  

enter		animate chart  
	h/l 	time increment  
	k/j 	up/down  

p			toggle planet/point data  
o 			toggle retro/speed data  

i			input chart data  

INPUT CHART DATA

i			INSERT mode  

	\		exit/save data input  
	F1		clear fields  
	tab		fill local time  
	arrows	navigate  

esc			NORMAL mode  

	enter	draw chart 

	w		save chart  
	e		load chart  
	q		exit data input  

	k/j		up/down  
	h/l		left/right  

DATA DIRECTORIES

city-db $XDG_DATA_HOME/astro
swisseph/ephe/ $XDG_DATA_HOME/astro
charts/ $XDG_DATA_HOME/astro

swiss ephemeris header files: /usr/local/include  
swiss ephemeris library: /usr/local/lib  
compiled astro binary: /usr/local/bin  
 
OPTIONAL

create a file named 'config' in ~/.config/astro to set local timezone and location  
config template between ```, timezone is IANA format  
 
```
timezone = America/Chicago
latitude = 41.85003
longitude = -87.65005
```
 
